["The kitchen where I live alone",
"I open Mom's recipe",
"her handwriting is round",
"it says 'a little salt'",
"A little? How much is that?",
"I stroke the call button",
"The knife's sound echoes",
"I'm back in that day's kitchen",
"When I light the flame",
"the oil starts to jump",
"The handwritten note",
"I keep gazing at",
"Sizzle sizzle, it pops",
"the frying pan's song",
"Bubble bubble, the pot",
"answers back",
"Closer and closer",
"to the salt of memory",
"Even though I'm all alone",
"it feels like a festival",
"Wait for it,",
"wait for it,",
"the steam",
"is rising",
"The pot sings, bubble bubble",
"The pan answers with a sizzle",
"A one-person orchestra",
"though one chair is left over",
"Turn up the heat",
"and go for it",
"Mom's favorite words",
"ring in my ears",
"Sizzle sizzle, it pops",
"once I turn up the heat",
"the smell fills",
"the whole room",
"Beyond the steam",
"I see Mom's back",
"'It tastes the same'",
"that's what I want to say",
"Sizzle sizzle, it pops",
"the frying pan's song",
"Bubble bubble, the pot",
"answers back",
"'Thanks for the meal,' I say",
"all by myself",
"Someday when I go home, I'll cook it for her",
"Plate it up, it's done. Let's eat!"]
